  "note": "All ten materials sample the SHARED DEMIGOL KIT ATLAS, measured off the file nodes - not a golem-specific map set. A consumer that already has the buildings already has these three maps, and the FBX carries the UVs into them. The ten names differ only in emission: one base material plus five seam-glow variants and four tracer emitters."
 },
